    `GET /sapi/v1/localentity/vasp` response instead of the previously expected `vaspCode`.
  - Both `vaspCode` and `identifier` will be accepted for the `vasp` field in the deposit and
    withdrawal questionnaires during the transition period until **28 May 2026**.

