- `REJECTED`
- `EXCHANGE_CANCELED`
- `OCO_TRIGGER`
- `OTO_PHASE_ONE_EXPIRED`
- `UNFILLED_IOC_QUANTITY_EXPIRED`
- `UNFILLED_FOK_ORDER_EXPIRED`
- `INSUFFICIENT_LIQUIDITY`
- `EXECUTION_RULE_PRICE_RANGE_EXCEEDED`



