### 2025-12-09

- [Schema for FIX SBE](/products/spot/sbe/schemas/spot-fixsbe-1_0.xml) has been updated to use
  `smallGroupSize16Encoding` in `MarketDataSnapshot` and use `presence="optional"` for incremental
  book ticker/depth `MDEntrySize` fields.
- Updated documentation re: [FIX vs FIX SBE](/products/spot/fix-api#fix-vs-fix-sbe)
- Added documentation in REST, and WebSocket APIs stating: <br>**Please avoid SQL keywords in
  requests** as they may trigger a security block by a WAF (Web Application Firewall) rule. <br> See
  https://www.binance.com/en/support/faq/detail/360004492232 for more details.

