    to perform transfer of assets under specific rules . More detail see the API description below.
  - **GET /sapi/v1/margin/loan-group/ltv-details** : parentAccountFrozenAmount, maxTransferOutAmount
    , maxAllowedBorrowLimit added into response Example.

## 2025-06-20

