# Introduction

Binance Fund Account provides fund services similar to traditional finance, meeting growing market
demand from fund managers and investors seeking similar features and capabilities in the
digital-asset space. For more information on this, please refer to the
[Binance Fund Account](https://www.binance.com/en/fund-account).



