  - `POST /dapi/v1/batchOrders`
  - `PUT  /dapi/v1/order`
  - `PUT  /dapi/v1/batchOrders`

  **Portfolio Margin (`/papi`)**
  - `POST /papi/v1/um/order`
  - `PUT /papi/v1/um/order`
  - `POST /papi/v1/um/conditional/order`
  - `POST /papi/v1/cm/order`
