## 2020-05-11

USDⓈ-M Futures

- New endpoint `POST /fapi/v1/countdownCancelAll` to cancel all open orders of the specified symbol
  at the end of the specified countdown.  
  This rest endpoint means to ensure your open orders are canceled in case of an outage. The
  endpoint should be called repeatedly as heartbeats so that the existing countdown time can be
  canceled and repalced by a new one.

