## Document: /products/derivatives-trading-portfolio-margin-pro/change-log

URL: /en/docs/products/derivatives-trading-portfolio-margin-pro/change-log


# Change Log

## 2026-08-21

**Effective Date: 2026-08-21**

USDⓈ-M Futures

- `ALGO_UPDATE` (Algo Order Update)
  - The `ia` field (introduced in the [2026-08-07](#2026-08-07) entry) is now fully active — no
    longer a placeholder. For trailing stop orders, before the order triggers (Algo Status `X`
    remains `NEW`), you may receive two separate `ALGO_UPDATE` `NEW` push events: one with
    `ia:false`, followed by another with `ia:true` once the order is activated.

Portfolio Margin

- `ALGO_UPDATE` (Algo Order Update)
  - The `ia` field (introduced in the [2026-08-07](#2026-08-07) entry) is now fully active — no
    longer a placeholder. For trailing stop orders, before the order triggers (Algo Status `X`
    remains `NEW`), you may receive two separate `ALGO_UPDATE` `NEW` push events: one with
    `ia:false`, followed by another with `ia:true` once the order is activated.

---

## 2026-08-17

**Effective Date: 2026-08-17**

USDⓈ-M Futures

- `GET /fapi/v1/tradingSchedule` (Trading Schedule) and the Trading Session Stream now cover the
  China equity market (`CN_EQUITY` / `CN_EquityUpdate`), with session types "REGULAR" and
  "NO_TRADING".

---

## 2026-08-14

COIN-M Futures

- `GET /futures/data/topLongShortAccountRatio` (Top Trader Long/Short Ratio (Accounts)): fixed
  request parameter `symbol` → `pair`; added optional `contractType` parameter (`PERPETUAL` /
  `CURRENT_QUARTER` / `NEXT_QUARTER`; omit for aggregated data across all contract types).
- `GET /futures/data/globalLongShortAccountRatio` (Long/Short Ratio): added optional `contractType`
  parameter (`PERPETUAL` / `CURRENT_QUARTER` / `NEXT_QUARTER`; omit for aggregated data across all
  contract types).
- `GET /futures/data/openInterestHist` (Open Interest Statistics): corrected `contractType` from
  documented-as-required to optional (`PERPETUAL` / `CURRENT_QUARTER` / `NEXT_QUARTER`; omit for
  aggregated data across all contract types; server behavior unchanged).
- `GET /futures/data/topLongShortPositionRatio` (Top Trader Long/Short Ratio (Positions)): added
  optional `contractType` parameter (`PERPETUAL` / `CURRENT_QUARTER` / `NEXT_QUARTER`; omit for
  aggregated data across all contract types).

---

## 2026-08-11

**Effective Date: 2026-08-13**

USDⓈ-M Futures

- `GET /fapi/v1/aggTrades` (Compressed/Aggregate Trades List): the maximum queryable trade history
  lookback (counted from now) is extended from 24 hours to 48 hours.

---

## 2026-08-07

**Effective Date: 2026-08-07**

USDⓈ-M Futures

- `ACCOUNT_UPDATE` (Balance and Position Update)
  - The `a` object now includes a new field `S` (STRING): the symbol associated with the event. Only
    pushed when the event reason type `m` is `FUNDING_FEE`.
- `ALGO_UPDATE` (Algo Order Update)
  - The `o` object now includes a new field `ia` (BOOLEAN): whether the algo order has been
    activated. Only meaningful for trailing stop orders.
  - Note: `ia` is currently a placeholder field and will always return `false`. It will be fully
    functional in a future release.

COIN-M Futures

- `ACCOUNT_UPDATE` (Balance and Position Update)
  - The `a` object now includes a new field `S` (STRING): the symbol associated with the event. Only
    pushed when the event reason type `m` is `FUNDING_FEE`.

Portfolio Margin

- `ACCOUNT_UPDATE` (Futures Balance and Position Update)
  - The `a` object now includes a new field `S` (STRING): the symbol associated with the event. Only
    pushed when the event reason type `m` is `FUNDING_FEE`.
- `ALGO_UPDATE` (Algo Order Update)
  - The `ao` object now includes a new field `ia` (BOOLEAN): whether the algo order has been
    activated. Only meaningful for trailing stop orders.
  - Note: `ia` is currently a placeholder field and will always return `false`. It will be fully
    functional in a future release.

