## 2024-04-01

USDⓈ-M Futures

WEBSOCKET API

- Websocket API is now available and can be accessed through this URL:
  `wss://ws-fapi.binance.com/ws-fapi/v1`
- WebSocket API allows placing orders, canceling orders, etc. through a WebSocket connection.
- WebSocket API is a separate service from WebSocket Market Data streams. I.e., placing orders and
  listening to market data requires two separate WebSocket connections.
- WebSocket API is subject to the same Filter and Rate Limit rules as REST API.
- WebSocket API and REST API are functionally equivalent: they provide the same features, accept the
  same parameters, return the same status and error codes.

