  - `GET /papi/v1/um/feeBurn`: Get UM Futures BNB Burn status.
- New Endpoints to Query Account Information:
  - `GET /papi/v1/um/accountConfig`: Query user UM account configuration.
  - `GET /papi/v1/um/symbolConfig`: Query user symbol configuration.
  - `GET /papi/v2/um/account`: Compared to `GET /papi/v1/um/account`, this endpoint only returns
    symbols that the user has positions or open orders in. Configuration-related fields have been
    removed and can now be queried from `GET /papi/v1/um/symbolConfig` and
    `GET /papi/v1/um/accountConfig`. The V2 endpoint also offers better performance.

