## 2024-04-09

USDⓈ-M Futures/ COIN-M Futures / Portfolio Margin

WEBSOCKET API

- Good-Till-Cancel (GTC) timeInForce will have a one-year validity period after order placement. GTC
  orders longer than one-year will be automatically canceled. This applies to all order types
  including reduceOnly but does not affect part-filled orders or strategy trading or copy-trading
  orders.

