## 2020-04-14

USDⓈ-M Futures

WEB SOCKET STREAM

- WebSocket connections have a limit of 10 incoming messages per second. A message is considered:
  - A PING frame
  - A PONG frame
  - A JSON control message (e.g. subscribe, unsubscribe)
- A connection that goes beyond the limit will be disconnected; IPs that are repeatedly disconnected
  may be banned.
- A single connection can listen to a maximum of 200 streams.

