**Time-sensitive Notice**

- `POST /dapi/v1/countdownCancelAll` (COIN-M Auto-Cancel All Open Orders / Countdown)
  - The COIN-M countdown (auto-cancel) feature will be **suspended on 2026-06-29 at 09:00 UTC (17:00
