## Document: /products/copy-trading/Introduction

URL: /en/docs/products/copy-trading/Introduction


# Introduction

Binance Copy Trading is an automated trading system. You can become a lead trader and let other
traders copy your portfolio, or copy lead traders’ portfolios as a copy trader. After determining
your investment amount, the system will automatically copy trades from the lead traders you follow.



