## Document: /products/connect-prime/quick-start

URL: /en/docs/products/connect-prime/quick-start



# Getting Started

This section helps institutional partners prepare for Institutional Embedded Buy/Sell Solution
integration.

## Before you begin

This product uses a server-to-server integration model. Most API calls require a `userId`, obtained
after completing the required user onboarding flow through Binance Link / KYC SaaS where applicable.

## Recommended integration order

1. Complete product onboarding with Binance.
2. Confirm Binance Link / KYC SaaS dependency and user onboarding flow.
3. Configure credentials, request signing, and IP whitelist.
4. Implement the required buy and/or sell flow.
5. Implement merchant-side callback APIs.
6. Implement webhook verification and order status handling.
7. Complete testing and go-live validation.



---

## Document: /products/connect-prime/introduction

URL: /en/docs/products/connect-prime/introduction



# Institutional Embedded Buy/Sell Solution

Institutional Embedded Buy/Sell Solution is the Binance Pay Onchain product path for institutional
clients that want to embed crypto buy/sell services directly inside their own financial product.

This product path is designed for institutional clients, banks, fintechs, brokers, and large
platforms that want to offer crypto services inside their own application while keeping control of
their fiat operations and customer relationship.

## What it supports

- Buy flow and sell flow.
- Real-time quote retrieval and quote execution.
- Transaction query, balance query, and market data.
- Merchant-side callback APIs and webhook notifications.

> This product path may require institutional onboarding, Binance Link / KYC SaaS integration,
> merchant-side callback APIs, webhooks, and product-specific credential enablement.



