# Getting Started

Use this section to prepare your Hosted Ramp & Onchain Payment APIs integration.

## Recommended integration order

1. Confirm your approved product scope with Binance.
2. Apply for or confirm your partner developer account.
3. Configure credentials, request signing, and IP whitelist where required.
4. Review environments and API base URLs.
5. Review landing page and redirection behavior.
6. Implement the relevant product flow: On-ramp APIs, Onchain Payment APIs, or Merchant Payout to
   Binance Account APIs.
7. Implement webhook handling.
8. Test the integration in Sandbox.
9. Confirm production readiness with Binance.

> Some capabilities are disabled by default or approval-based. Confirm enabled capabilities with
> your Binance representative before implementation.



