# Account and Credentials

Before integrating, partners need to apply for or confirm access to a partner developer account.

| Credential                | Description                                                                                                            |
| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `X-Tesla-ClientId`        | Partner client ID provided by Binance.                                                                                 |
| `X-Tesla-SignAccessToken` | Access token provided by Binance.                                                                                      |
| RSA key pair              | The partner generates the key pair. The private key is kept by the partner, and the public key is shared with Binance. |
| IP whitelist              | Server IPs authorized to call Binance APIs, where required.                                                            |
| Webhook callback URL      | Partner callback URL used to receive event updates.                                                                    |

> **Important:** Credentials and product access are specific to the approved integration. Do not
> assume credentials for another Binance Pay Onchain product path can be used here.



