| **Attributes** | **Type** | **Required** | **Limitation** | **Description**                       |
| -------------- | -------- | ------------ | -------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| **account**    | string   | Y            |                | Binance ID of receiver to be deleted. |

### Sample Request Parameter

```json
{
