<tr>
<td>
Create Order in Crypto

```json
{
  "env": {
    "terminalType": "APP"
  },
  "merchantTradeNo": "9825382937292",
  "orderAmount": 25.17,
  "currency": "USDT",
  "description": "very good Ice Cream",
  "goodsDetails": [
    {
      "goodsType": "01",
      "goodsCategory": "D000",
      "referenceGoodsId": "7876763A3B",
      "goodsName": "Ice Cream",
      "goodsDetail": "Greentea ice cream cone"
    }
  ]
}
```

