# Introduction

Access Binance Algo Order strategies via API to automate and optimise order execution. Execute large
or illiquid orders with institutional-grade intelligent algorithmic order strategies. Please contact
trading@binance.com if you have any questions on Binance Algos.

[Frequently Asked Questions on Binance Algo Orders](https://www.binance.com/en/support/faq/detail/91d7e7d0633846adb0ef9020037cc391)

What Are Algorithmic Orders?
[TWAP & POV Strategies for Crypto Trading](https://www.binance.com/en/blog/otc/what-are-algorithmic-orders-twap--pov-strategies-for-crypto-trading-572102887905225345)



