| city             | STRING | YES       | Originator’s city/village/town.                                                                                                               |
| txnPurpose       | STRING | YES       | Value: service, goods, p2p, charity, others                                                                                                   |
| txnPurposeOthers | STRING | YES \*1   |                                                                                                                                               |

