| `pendingClientOrderId`    | STRING  | NO        | Arbitrary unique ID among open orders for the pending order. Automatically generated if not sent.                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| `pendingPrice`            | DECIMAL | NO        |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
| `pendingStopPrice`        | DECIMAL | NO        |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
