    "status": "NEW",
    "timeInForce": "GTC",
    "type": "LIMIT",
    "side": "SELL",
    "workingTime": 1741926410242,
    "selfTradePreventionMode": "NONE"
  }
}
```

Response for an order that is part of an Order list:

