- Features that currently require an Ed25519 API key will soon be opened up to HMAC and RSA keys.
  - For example, subscribing to User Data Stream in WebSocket API will be possible with any API key
    type before listenKeys are removed.
  - Users are still encouraged to migrate to Ed25519 API keys as they are more secure and performant
    on Binance Spot Trading.
  - More details to come.

