  "timeInForce": "GTC",
  "type": "LIMIT",
  "side": "BUY",
  "stopPrice": "0.000000",
  "icebergQty": "0.000000",
  "time": 1670217090310,
  "updateTime": 1670217090330,
  "isWorking": true,
  "workingTime": 1670217090310,
  "origQuoteOrderQty": "0.000000",
  "selfTradePreventionMode": "NONE"
}
```

Order Status of the Taker Order

```json
