# APIs V2 — Recommended

APIs V2 is the recommended API reference for Agentic Payments.

- Get Supported Configurations
- Verify Payment
- Settle Payment
- Permit2 Signing Guide

Supported payment assets include USDT, USDC, U, and USD1.

> New integrations should use APIs V2 unless Binance specifically instructs otherwise.



