## Document: /products/onchainpay-x402/open-apis/0.overview

URL: /en/docs/products/onchainpay-x402/open-apis/0.overview



# Legacy APIs V1

Legacy APIs V1 is available for existing Agentic Payments integrations that were built on the
previous API version.

New integrations should use APIs V2 — Recommended unless Binance specifically instructs otherwise.

## API groups

- Get Supported Configurations
- Verify Payment
- Settle Payment



