## Document: Workspace Member Management

URL: /en/docs/products/mini-program/management/workspace-member-management


# Workspace Member Management

### Managing Your Workspace Membership

As an Admin within the workspace, you can manage users in the Developer role. Users can be added to
the workspace via email, or removed using the delete button.

Three roles are available for users in the workspace:

- Admin
- Developer (for developing the mini program)
- Operator (for managing the mini program post-launch)

The specific permissions accorded to each role are tabulated below:

|                              | Admin | Developer | Operator |
| ---------------------------- | ----- | --------- | -------- |
| View summary                 | √     | √         | √        |
| Create MP                    | √     | √         |          |
| View MP information          | √     | √         | √        |
| Edit MP information          | √     | √         | √        |
| Stop/Start service           | √     | √         |          |
| Upload                       | √     | √         |          |
| Create QR code               | √     | √         |          |
| MP Version management        | √     | √         |          |
| Edit app details(Web app)    | √     | √         |          |
| Customer Analysis            | √     |           | √        |
| View Monitor                 | √     | √         |          |
| Development Setting          | √     | √         |          |
| MP Member Management         | √     | √         |          |
| Experience member management | √     | √         | √        |
| Localization management      | √     | √         | √        |
| Workspace Member management  | √     | √         | √        |

### Workspace Membership Management Page

As Workspace users, you can grant access rights to developers.

![img](/img/mp-management/workspace-member-management-page.png)

![img](/img/mp-management/workspace-memeber-management.png)

### Application Member Management Page

As Application developers, you can extend access rights to developers who are already Workspace
users.

![img](/img/mp-management/application-member-management.png)



