## Document: Upload to mini program platform

URL: /en/docs/products/mini-program/devtools/upload


# Upload to mini program platform

To use the IDE, log in with your Binance account and ensure your APPID is accurate (located in the
Details Panel). If your project was initiated with CLI, run the following command in the root
directory of the project to generate code for a real device:

```bash
$ bmp build
```

![img](https://bin.bnbstatic.com/image/julia/docs/mini-program/ide-6.png)

By clicking 'Upload' in the Tool Bar, the IDE will bundle and upload your application. Post-upload,
manage your app version via the [mpp website](https://developers.binance.com/en/mpp/).



