# Order status

| **Code** | **Type**   | **Description**                                                            | **Remarks** |
| -------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------- |
| 1        | PROCESSING | The order is being processed and the transaction is ongoing.               |             |
| 20       | FILLED     | The transaction has been successfully completed. This is a final state.    |             |
| 99       | FAILED     | The transaction has failed and the order is closed. This is a final state. |             |



