### Response Body (list of json object)

| **Field**        | **Type** | **Remarks**            |
| ---------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |
| fiatCurrency     | string   |                        |
| cryptoCurrencies | array    | Crypto currency object |
| cryptoCurrency   | string   | Crypto currency symbol |

### Example

