## Document: /products/connect-2.0/compliance-refund-data-sharing/1.use-cases-and-eligibility

URL: /en/docs/products/connect-2.0/compliance-refund-data-sharing/1.use-cases-and-eligibility



# Use Cases and Eligibility

Compliance and Refund Data Sharing may support approved partner use cases such as compliance review,
risk review, refund handling, reconciliation, and regulatory-support workflows.

This capability is not enabled by default. Eligibility and field availability are subject to Binance
review and approval.

When Compliance and Refund Data Sharing is approved and enabled, the relevant user-level and
refund-related data may be delivered through the existing order-status webhook payload.

Contact your Binance representative to confirm whether this capability is available for your
integration.



