    and `NO_TRADING`.
- WebSocket Stream `tradingSession` (Trading Session Stream)
  - Added Korean equity market support.
  - Added new event type `KR_EquityUpdate`. Korean equity market session types: `REGULAR` and
    `NO_TRADING`.

