| `column-gap`      | `number`      |                |         |
| `row-gap`         | `number`      |                |         |
| `gap`             | `number`      |                |         |
| `justify-content` | `'start'      | 'center'       | 'end'   | 'space-between' | 'space-around' | 'space-evenly' | 'stretch'`  |     | `"start"` |
