## Document: DeprecatedCanvas

URL: /en/docs/products/mini-program/framework/components/DeprecatedCanvas


# DeprecatedCanvas

This component is rendered using web canvas component. The difference between `<deprecated-canvas>`
and `<canvas>` is that `<canvas>` is provided by native while `<deprecated-canvas>` is created in
web environment.

`<deprecated-canvas>` only supports easy rendering method. These methods are not supported:
createImageData, getImageData, putImageData, measureText

**Example**

```html
<deprecated-canvas></deprecated-canvas>
```

- **remark** - supported jssdk >= 4.1.0 in mini program



