## Check status

> "Is my wallet connected?"

> "Which chain am I on? What networks are supported?"

> "What's my wallet address?"

The Agent answers in plain language — for example: "Your wallet is connected and you're on BNB Smart
Chain. Supported networks include BSC, Ethereum, and Solana. Your address is 0x1234...5678."

## Check balances

> "What are all my token balances?"

> "How much USDT do I have?"

> "What's the total USD value of my assets?"

The Agent lists your holdings with valuations — for example: "You hold about 1.2 BNB (~$740), 350
USDT, and 0.05 ETH (~$160), for a total of roughly $1,250 across your assets."

## View transaction history

> "What are my recent transactions?"

> "Are there any pending transactions?"

> "Check the status of transaction 0xabc123..."

The Agent summarizes your activity in plain language — for example: "Your last transaction was a
swap of 0.1 BNB for USDT that finished successfully about an hour ago. You have no pending
transactions, and transaction 0xabc123... has been confirmed on-chain."

## Check daily quota

> "How much of my daily limit is left today?"

> "What's my daily limit and how much have I used?"

The Agent reports your quota in plain language — for example: "Your daily limit is $5,000. You've
used about $1,200 so far today, leaving roughly $3,800 available."

## What's next

