## Document: bn.getMpcProvider

URL: /en/docs/products/mini-program/framework/api/openapis/getMpcProvider


# bn.getMpcProvider

▸ **getMpcProvider**(): `Web3Provider`

**`description`** The api to get web3 provider

**`remark`** supported jssdk >= 4.0.0

**`example`**

```ts
//eg1: get web3 provider and then request with method
bn.getMpcProvider()
  .request({
    method: "eth_requestAccounts",
  })
  .then((accounts) => {
    console.log("accounts", accounts);
  });
```

Returns

`Web3Provider`

