# bn.dateTimeFormat

▸ **dateTimeFormat**(`timestamp`, `options`): `string`

**`description`** format date time.

**`remark`** supported jssdk >= 4.36.0

**`example`**

```ts
bn.dateTimeFormat(1659971700000, {
  year: "numeric",
  month: "short",
  day: "numeric",
});
