| header?   | `Record`<`string`, `string`\> | HTTP request header, cannot set referer here |
| timeout?  | `number`                      | timeout**`default`** 2000                    |
| filePath? | `string`                      | save path after file is downloaded           |
| success?  | (`result`): `void`            | success callback                             |
