**`description`** Create directory.

**`example`**

```ts
bn.getFileSystemManager().mkdir({
  dirPath: "a/b/c/d",
  recursive: true,
  success(res) {
    console.log(res);
  },
});
```

Parameters

| Name      | Type             |
| :-------- | :--------------- |
| `options` | `FsMkdirOptions` |

Returns

`Promise`<{}\>

